WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.650
the page of history that is 1965&nbsp;
began with the inauguration of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.270
36th President of the United States&nbsp;
Lyndon Baines Johnson who succeeded&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:19.050
to the office after the tragedy in Dallas&nbsp;
set the tone for a great society we seek&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:32.400
no dominion over our fellow man but&nbsp;
man's dominion over tyranny and misery

